{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id997944781"}, "name":{"label":"DawnFL28"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-27T10:47:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14479036288"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t use it!"}, "content":{"label":"I thought the app would be great. I signed up for the year, signed in, and then got to the page where you can opt out of tracking.  Except it took up the whole screen, and I couldn’t do anything. Now it’s stuck there with no way to get past it. Very disappointing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id169001920"}, "name":{"label":"Chef Scott321"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-27T10:38:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14479010008"}, "title":{"label":"Total disappointment"}, "content":{"label":"I was so excited to see Allrecipes bring back an app. How terribly disappointing it is. It doesn’t size to an iPad. You have to pay or ads pop up. There is no view that shows the whole recipe so you have to scroll as you cook. You can’t print. Basically worthless. What a bummer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id100914240"}, "name":{"label":"Parsley Queen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-27T10:36:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14479003493"}, "title":{"label":"All my recipes in one place"}, "content":{"label":"I already had a MyRecipes account, so I love that all I had to do was log in to the app and all of my saved recipes and collections were right there. It will make cooking so much easier because I’m not bouncing between different screens trying to find ingredients and directions. I also love being able to save recipes I find on Instagram. They’re imported as easy-to-follow recipes that I can edit and add to my collections alongside everything else I’ve saved. So convenient!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"6"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"10"}}, 
